<DocsLayout title="Aurora FAQ" description="Frequently asked questions about Aurora projects and public availability." heading="Frequently asked questions" eyebrow="DOCUMENTATION / FAQ">
<h2>Is Aurora OS available to install?</h2><p>No verified public installation release is listed on this website. Check <a href="/en/downloads/">Downloads</a> for current release information.</p><h2>What is Lumen?</h2><p>Lumen is the name used for the Aurora Browser workstream. Its implementation status and capabilities are not verified by this website update.</p><h2>Where can I get OS add-ons or browser extensions?</h2><p>The <a href="/en/ecosystem/os/add-ons/">Aurora OS add-ons</a> and <a href="/en/ecosystem/browser/extensions/">Lumen extensions</a> pages are catalogue entry points. They do not currently distribute packages.</p><h2>How can I contribute?</h2><p>Start with the <a href="/en/community/contributing/">contribution page</a> and open issues or pull requests in the relevant public repository.</p>
</DocsLayout>